OL,3,APolice begin operation to move migrants
OL,4,Afrom Ceuta beaches
OL,5,
OL,6,FMost of the 72,000 migrants who
OL,7,Fbreached the border from Morocco in
OL,8,FJuly have returned. Ceuta's authorities
OL,9,Fhave estimated that 13,000 remain in
OL,10,Fthe enclave, but the Spanish central
OL,11,Fgovernment has said it is lower.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/38
